<p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #A3ACB9; margin: 0; max-width: 640px; text-wrap: pretty">Hackathons started as coding sprints. Today they power product development, entrepreneurship and innovation — in companies, cities and communities all over Belgium. Here's how a typical weekend goes.</p>
